# 35. Example Analysis Scenario

Suppose you receive:

```text
unknown.exe
```

### Step 1 — Hash

Calculate:

```text
SHA-256
```

### Step 2 — Identify

Determine:

```text
Windows PE executable
```

### Step 3 — Strings

You discover:

```text
example.test
config.dat
cmd.exe
```

### Step 4 — Ghidra

You find functions related to:

```text
network communication
file handling
process creation
```

### Step 5 — Controlled Dynamic Analysis

In an isolated lab, you observe:

```text
unknown.exe
     ↓
creates child process
     ↓
creates temporary file
     ↓
