# 49. Final Takeaway

The core idea of Day 44 is:

> **Static analysis tells you what a malware sample contains and may be capable of doing. Dynamic analysis tells you what it actually does under the conditions you observe.**

A professional analyst combines both:

```text
STATIC
  +
DYNAMIC
  ↓
CORRELATION
  ↓
BEHAVIOR UNDERSTANDING
  ↓
IOC EXTRACTION
  ↓
DETECTION & RESPONSE
```

**Day 44 Key Sentence:**

> **"Static analysis examines the sample without execution; dynamic analysis observes its behavior during controlled execution; tools such as Strings and Ghidra help reveal its structure, code, and indicators."**